# Data migrations approved for the VPS (automatic deploys of dev).
#
# A migration that changes existing rows (UPDATE, DELETE, INSERT) does not go
# live until it is named here. When a deploy stops with "Data migrations need
# approval", the run on GitHub prints the names. Add one line per name, in a pull
# request into dev; merging it deploys again with them approved.
#
# Names of migrations that have already run can stay; they are ignored.
#
# migration=2026_11_18_000001_example_name
